-- vm-ui -- the VM8 framed-box + custom-font shell (Stage 2). OPTIONAL chrome
-- with graceful fallback: core.set_box(box.draw_box) frames the text/menu boxes
-- (a portable +--+ 9-slice, NES no-op), and text.set_font(FONT_TILES) swaps the
-- console font (a no-op fallback to the built-in font on Lynx/PCE/NES). Both are
-- byte-behaviour-identical when unused -- and because engine.box is an OPT-IN
-- pack (this shell imports it, vm.core does not), a game that never frames a box
-- never links its draw_frame CODE.

